nterface.Contracts → Core is the only reference from an inner layer to Infrastructure." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=12;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2753" width="1550" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>